WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:01.980
At Google Cloud,

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.540
we give you a variety of ways to learn.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.180
We understand that some learn best

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.560
from hands-on labs

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.920
or through self-paced video courses on sites like

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.900
Coursera and Pluralsight,

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.790
while some prefer to learn directly from

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.499
Google Authorized Instructors,

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.140
or even a combination of all three methods.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.900
When it comes to instructor-led training,

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.780
it’s not always easy to get a group of

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.100
people physically together;

00:00:23.109 --> 00:00:25.480
but did you know you can get all the benefits

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.359
of in-person classroom training

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.020
without the hassle of travel?

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:32.040
We call this a virtual instructor-led training.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.760
With Google Cloud virtual instructor-led training,

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.520
our certified instructors use the same curriculum

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.180
as our in-person training.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.900
They will take you through the same demonstrations,

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.570
and run the same hands-on activities as they

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.360
would if you were in the same room together.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.920
The instructor and students connect via webcam,

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.420
developing a sense of community

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.080
like a traditional classroom.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.640
This creates an engaging environment

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.899
to answer questions

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.300
and aid in supporting students individually.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.560
To make things fun,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.360
we use interactive tools like

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.340
quizzes, polls, and even games!

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:04.640
In the virtual classroom,

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.380
flexibility is paramount.

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.280
Students can join from different locations

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:10.180
across multiple time zones.

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:11.680
Our customers rave about our

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.340
virtual instructor-led training.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.720
With one organization,

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.140
we ran 17 unique virtual classes

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.020
for 409 employees

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.830
across four different time zones!

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.660
They gave the overall experience a

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.960
98% satisfaction rating.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.400
Virtual instructor-led training offered the same

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.960
in-person experience with a certified trainer,

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:32.410
but at a scale and schedule logistically

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:34.190
difficult to achieve otherwise.

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:36.420
Google Cloud virtual instructor-led trainings

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.640
are open and ready for enrollment.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.000
You can check out our classroom schedule on

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.180
https://cloud.google.com/training/courses

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:46.900
or reach out to your Google representative

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:48.380
for more information.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.070
We eagerly await the opportunity

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:53.100
to e-meet you face to face in our virtual classroom.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.060
Hope to see you there!

